Joe Joe wrote:
>
> Is it possible to access a save made on one computer from another?

If you mean the exact same architecture, yes.  When I moved from one
Windows XP box to another I also changed domains and my username.  The
username was encoded in the name of the save file. I changed the name
of the save file and it started working.

Old freyburgerd-Doug.NetHack-saved-game
New doug.freyburger-Doug.NetHack-saved-game

Moving to a new OS probably won't work.  Moving version of Windows to
version of Windows, I don't know if it will work.


